Rule 4 (dtype-only elements must be valid boolean/numeric/complex codes: 0–10)
{v_1: tuple(dtype)} |= v_1.len ≥ 1 ∧ ∀i ∈ [0, v_1.len - 1] : 0 ≤ v_1[i] ∧ v_1[i] ≤ 10
