Rule 7 (dtype-only list should be non-decreasing in type promotion order)
{v_1: tuple(dtype)} |= v_1.len ≥ 2 ∧ ∀i ∈ [1, v_1.len - 1] : v_1[i] ≥ v_1[i - 1]
